<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>伤寒门 - 标签 | 观颐斋</title><link>https://lruihao.cn/tags/%E4%BC%A4%E5%AF%92%E9%97%A8/</link><description>这里不仅是我研习中医经典的私人书斋，更是一处致力于 “观照经典以明医理，颐养身心以扶正气” 的清净之地。</description><generator>Hugo 0.161.0 &amp; FixIt v1.0.0-alpha-mt895zhg</generator><language>zh-CN</language><managingEditor>acuherb@foxmail.com (Acuherb)</managingEditor><webMaster>acuherb@foxmail.com (Acuherb)</webMaster><copyright>本站内容采用 CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 国际许可协议。</copyright><lastBuildDate>Wed, 01 Jul 2026 10:40:52 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://lruihao.cn/tags/%E4%BC%A4%E5%AF%92%E9%97%A8/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>伤寒门</title><link>https://lruihao.cn/posts/6-1-shanghanmen/</link><pubDate>Wed, 01 Jul 2026 10:33:52 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (Acuherb)</author><guid>https://lruihao.cn/posts/6-1-shanghanmen/</guid><category domain="https://lruihao.cn/categories/%E5%8D%B7%E5%85%AD%E6%95%B0%E9%9B%86/">卷六数集</category><description>本节为《石室秘录》“伤寒门”部分，由&lt;strong&gt;雷公真君&lt;/strong&gt;系统论述伤寒传经变证、危重症及产后感邪的辨治法则，并传系列救急奇方。核心思想是：&lt;strong&gt;伤寒危证多因正气衰微、阴阳离决，当以峻补元气、回阳救逆为主，辅以清热、散寒、祛邪、生津，于死中求生。传经有顺、过、隔、两感之别，各立主方；诸般死症，察其一线生机而力挽之&lt;/strong&gt;。</description></item></channel></rss>